# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore — applies ONLY to the api-gateway build and
# replaces the root .dockerignore for it. The context is the monorepo ROOT, so
# this is an allowlist: everything is excluded except the files the Dockerfile
# COPYs (the gateway script, its email templates, the pre-built @grobase/js).
*
!apps/opposite-osiris/scripts/auth-gateway.mjs
!apps/opposite-osiris/scripts/auth
!apps/opposite-osiris/src/email-templates
!apps/opposite-osiris/vendor/grobase-js/package.json
!apps/opposite-osiris/vendor/grobase-js/lib
**/node_modules
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
